sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client
  participant API as Auth API
  participant OAuth as OAuth Provider
  participant Mongo as MongoDB
  participant Redis as Redis Bitmap And Cache
  participant Token as Token Service

  Client->>API: GET /auth/oauth/:provider
  API->>API: Create CSRF state
  API-->>Client: Redirect to provider authorize URL

  Client->>API: GET /auth/callback
  API->>API: Validate CSRF state
  API->>OAuth: Exchange authorization code
  OAuth-->>API: Provider profile with email and subject
  API->>API: Canonicalize provider email
  API->>Mongo: Find user by provider subject

  alt User found by provider subject
    Mongo-->>API: Existing linked user
    API->>Redis: SET user:email:{sha256(email)}
    API->>Redis: SETBIT bitmap:users:email:v1
    API->>Redis: DEL nf:email:{sha256(email)}
    API->>Token: Issue access and refresh tokens
    API-->>Client: Redirect to frontend callback
  else No provider-subject match
    API->>Mongo: Find user by canonical email
    alt User found by email
      API->>Mongo: Link provider subject to existing user
      API->>Redis: SET user:email:{sha256(email)}
      API->>Redis: SETBIT bitmap:users:email:v1
      API->>Redis: DEL nf:email:{sha256(email)}
      API->>Token: Issue access and refresh tokens
      API-->>Client: Redirect to frontend callback
    else No user found
      API->>Mongo: Create OAuth user under unique email index
      alt Create succeeds
        API->>Redis: SET user:email:{sha256(email)}
        API->>Redis: SETBIT bitmap:users:email:v1
        API->>Redis: DEL nf:email:{sha256(email)}
        API->>Token: Issue access and refresh tokens
        API-->>Client: Redirect to frontend callback
      else Duplicate key race
        API->>Mongo: Re-read user by canonical email and link if allowed
        API->>Redis: SET user:email:{sha256(email)}
        API->>Redis: SETBIT bitmap:users:email:v1
        API->>Redis: DEL nf:email:{sha256(email)}
        API->>Token: Issue access and refresh tokens
        API-->>Client: Redirect to frontend callback
      end
    end
  end
